OL,6,FA decision on whether or not a
OL,7,Fcontroversial Drumcree parade by the
OL,8,FOrange Order in Portadown is to be
OL,9,Fre-routed is to be announced
OL,11,FThe Parades Commission has been
OL,12,Fdeliberating whether the parade will be
OL,13,Fallowed along the mainly nationalist
OL,14,FGarvaghy Road
OL,16,FUnionist politicians have urged the
OL,17,Ffive-person commission to permit
OL,18,FSunday's march in spite of opposition
OL,19,Ffrom a group of local residents
